		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thousands of vomit-green Abyss wasps. Razor-sharp claws, ominous buzzing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 claw +0 (1d6) and gibber or devour, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Devour</strong>. Chew up and devour wood, bone, organic material, or unconscious or helpless targets in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gibber</strong>. All mortals within near of swarm, WIS 12+ or confused for 1 round. Immune for 1 day if passed check.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
